\n \nसड़क परिवहन औि िाजमार्ग मंत्री \n \nbe pleased to state: \n \n(a)  whether the Government proposes to impose green tax on older \nvehicles to curb air pollution in the country and if so, the details \nthereof; \n(b)  the details of estimated number of older vehicles plying on roads \nin the country, State-wise; \n(c)   whether the said green tax will vary from State to State in the \ncountry and if so, the details of rates, State-wise; \n(d)   whether the Government has information regarding rate of green \ntax levied by major developed and developing countries and if so, \nthe details thereof; and \n(e)  whether the Government has made any impact assessment of \nimposing green tax and if so, the details thereof along with the \nother measures being taken by the Government in this regard? \n \n \nANSWER \n \nTHE MINISTER OF ROAD TRANSPORT AND HIGHWAYS \n \n(SHRI NITIN JAIRAM GADKARI) \n \n(a)  to (e) A statement is laid on the Table of the House.  \n  \n\n \n \nSTATEMENT REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PARTS (a) to (e) OF THE LOK \nSABHA STARRED QUESTION NO. 421 ANSWERED ON 25.03.2021 \nASKED BY  DR. JAYANTA KUMAR ROY AND SHRI BHOLA SINGH  \nREGARDING GREEN TAX ON OLDER VEHICLES \n \n(a) Government has formulated guidelines for imposition of Green Tax \non older vehicles by State/UT Governments to dis -incentivize the use of \nolder and polluting vehicles. These have been circulated to States/UTs \nfor their comments.  \n \n(b) The details of estimat ed number of older vehicles plying on roads in \nthe country, State-wise, are placed at Annexure.  \n(c) to (e) Green tax is imposed by a few States/UTs at different rates. \n  \n\n \n \nANNEXURE REFEREED TO IN REPLY TO PART (b) OF LOK SABHA STARRED \nQUESTION NO. 421 ANSWE RED ON 25 TH MARCH, 2021 ASKED BY DR. \nJAYANTA KUMAR ROY AND SHRI BHOLA SINGH REGARDING GREEN TAX ON \nOLDER VEHICLES \nState/UT Vehicle Age   \n (15-20 Years)  ( >20 Years)    Grand Total \nAndaman & Nicobar Island 14,599 16,640 31,239 \nArunachal Prad