mber of beneficiaries under ‘Subordinate Debt for Stressed \nMSMEs’ is given at \nAnnexure\n-\nII.\n \n \nState/UT wise number of MSMEs registered on the ‘Udyam Registration’ \nPortal is given at \nAnnexure\n-\nIII.\n \n \n \n \n******\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\nAnnexure\n-\nI\n \n \nAnnexure \nrererred to in reply to part (a) & (b) \nto the Lok Sabha Starred Question No. *149 \nfor answer on 11.02.2021\n \n \nState/UT wise number of beneficiaries under ‘Rs. 3 Lakh Crore\n \nCollateral Free Automatic \nLoans for business, including MSMEs’ as on 25\nth\n \nJanuary, 2021 \n \nState/UT\n \nNumber of \nGuarantees \n \n% Number of \nGuarantees\n \nGuarantee Amount \n(Rs. in Crore)\n \n% Guarantee \nAmount\n \nANDAMAN AND \nNICOBAR ISLANDS\n \n1885\n \n0.02%\n \n92.09\n \n0.05%\n \nANDHRA \nPRADESH\n \n246973\n \n2.69%\n \n7489.3\n \n3.72%\n \nARUNACHAL PRADESH\n \n2181\n \n0.02%\n \n62.51\n \n0.03%\n \nASSAM\n \n530121\n \n5.77%\n \n2443.6\n \n1.21%\n \nBIHAR\n \n644396\n \n7.01%\n \n3520.16\n \n1.75%\n \nCHANDIGARH\n \n6326\n \n0.07%\n \n779.5\n \n0.39%\n \nCHHATTISGARH\n \n135622\n \n1.48%\n \n3528.39\n \n1.75%\n \nDADRA AND NAGAR \nHAVELI\n \n2012\n \n0.02%\n \n170.72\n \n0.08%\n \nDAMAN AND DIU\n \n870\n \n0.01%\n \n115.86\n \n0.06%\n \nDELHI\n \n89128\n \n0.97%\n \n11814.73\n \n5.87%\n \nGOA\n \n11562\n \n0.13%\n \n631.02\n \n0.31%\n \nGUJARAT\n \n284716\n \n3.10%\n \n18996.94\n \n9.43%\n \nHARYANA\n \n154876\n \n1.69%\n \n9444.42\n \n4.69%\n \nHIMACHAL PRADESH\n \n46102\n \n0.50%\n \n1341.92\n \n0.67%\n \nJAMMU AND KASHMIR\n \n66631\n \n0.73%\n \n1841.39\n \n0.91%\n \nJHARKHAND\n \n239019\n \n2.60%\n \n2396.1\n \n1.19%\n \nKARNATAKA\n \n445454\n \n4.85%\n \n13044.81\n \n6.48%\n \nKERALA\n \n399278\n \n4.34%\n \n7075.54\n \n3.51%\n \nLADAKH\n \n994\n \n0.01%\n \n43.21\n \n0.02%\n \nLAKSHADWEEP\n \n355\n \n0.00%\n \n1.68\n \n0.00%\n \nMADHYA PRADESH\n \n373685\n \n4.07%\n \n6965.54\n \n3.46%\n \nMAHARASHTRA\n \n79