n \nDEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE, COOPERATION AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \n \nLOK SABHA\n \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.\n77\n                    \n \nTO BE ANSWERED ON THE \n2\nND \nFEBRUARY\n,\n \n20\n21\n \n \nKRISHONNATI YOJANA \n \n \n77.\n \nSHRI SUBRAT PATHAK: \n \n \nWill the Minister of AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \n \nकृ\u0000ष\n \nएवं \n\u0000कसान \nक\u0000याण \nमं\u0000ी\n \nbe pleased to state:\n \n \n \n(a)\n \nwhether the Green Revolution \n–\n \nKrishonnati\n \nYojana introduced in the agricultural \nsector for the period\n \n2017\n-\n18 to 2019\n-\n20 \nhas reached completion;\n \n \n(b)\n \nthe details of the achievements made by the\n \nGovernment in this regard;\n \n \n(c)\n \nthe number of schemes/missions covered under\n \nthis by the Government;\n \n \n(d)\n \nthe manner in which it is likely to help in\n \ndoubling the income of farmers by\n \n2022; and\n \n \n(e)\n \nwhether the Government intends to extend it\n \nfurther and if so, the details thereof?\n \n \nANSWER\n \n \nMINISTER OF AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \n \nकृ\u0000ष\n \nएवं \n\u0000कसान \nक\u0000याण \nमं\u0000ी\n  \n   \n       \n( SHRI NARENDRA SINGH TOMAR)\n  \n \n \n(a):\n \nThe Scheme was for the \nperiod 2017\n-\n18 to 2019\n-\n20 and was extended till 2020\n-\n21.\n \n \n(b)\n:\n \nFinancial achievement for Krishonnati Yojana is at \nAnnexure \n–\n \nI.\n \n \n(c):\n \nA list of Schemes under Green Revolution  Krishonnati Yojana are at \nAnnexure \n–\n \nII\n.\n \n \n(d):\n \nAll the Schemes of this Ministry \nare aimed at improving/doubling the farmer’s income.\n \n \n(e):\n \nYes, Sir.\n \n \n \n \n \n \n\nAnnexure\n-\n \nI\n \n \n \n \nSCHEME WISE BE/ACTUAL EXPENDITURE IN   (AS ON 31.12.2020)                                                                    \n        \n(RS. IN CRORE)\n \n \nS.\n \nNo.\n \nMISSION/SCHEME GREEN REVOLUTION \n& KRISHONANTI YOJNA\n \n2017\n-\n18\n \n2018\n-\n19\n \n2019\n-\n20\n \n2020\n-\n21\n \n \n \nGREEN REVOLUTION & KRISHONANTI \nYOJNA\n 